--- USW_100_TS3_TS1 (US_inter_alpha) ---

Umbrella-sampling window set for the alpha isomer's TS3<->TS1 interconversion (see
../README). Restrains 'cowh' at 100 evenly spaced values (kappa=300) while pinning 'dD' at 0
(kappa=400), seeded from 'SMD_inter_alpha/TS3_TS1/repN/lmp_files/' on Vives. Same per-replica
layout as USW_100_TS1_TS2/ (see its README) -- 100 window subfolders plus WHAM/, not yet run.

Note: this README documents pre-existing content; no existing file was modified.
